  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CO-506696</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Overall Objective (OO) is to enhance the role of CSOs in strengthening the digital literacy and skills of young people, particularly girls and disadvantaged youth, to accelerate an inclusive digital transformation in Viet Nam. Specific Objectives (SOs) S01: Youth: Strengthened capacity of CSOs and youth-based organizations to contribute to technology-related policymaking towards an inclusive, gender-sensitive digital transformation. 02: Human-centred education: Strengthened digital literacy and skills of youth, particularly disadvantaged youth, and girls, through enhanced science, technology, engineering, and mathematics (STEM) curricula and digital training, providing opportunities for decent work in the digital services sector.</narrative>
  </description>
